    "https://www.vacancies.st-andrews.ac.uk/Vacancies/W/1662/0/474429/889/service-desk-assistant-cg8458": {
      "title": "Service Desk Assistant",
      "description": "Service Desk Assistant - CG8458 Register Login Back to search results Service Desk Assistant - CG8458 This is an excellent opportunity for the role-holder to contribute to the\ndevelopment, implementation and\nProvision of an efficient and effective, customer-oriented administration\nservice within the Estates Office.\nThe general office team provides support to a variety of Estates\npersonnel, dealing with and responding to a diverse and complex range of issues within an extremely busy working\nenvironment. St Andrews offers more than just a place\nto work—it is a place to belong. We value collegiality, inclusion,\nand wellbeing, and we are committed to creating\na workplace\nwhere staff can thrive and perform at their best. In addition to the salary on offer for\nthis position, there are a wide range of benefits for staff working at the\nUniversity of St Andrews. The package for the Service Desk Assistant role\nincludes: Financial\n    contribution to relocation (subject to eligibility) Membership\n    of the S&LAS Pension Scheme with generous employer contributions A\n    hybrid working environment, including partial homeworking where appropriate and\n    a range of family friendly policies, supporting work-life balance Staff\n    discount scheme for local and national goods and services Free\n    staff parking, employee Carshare and Cycle to Work Schemes and subsidised local\n    bus travel Subsidised\n    sports membership, reduced tuition fees on degree programmes for staff, access\n    to training and development opportunities including LinkedIn Learning, access\n    to library facilities, salary sacrifice scheme 30\n    Days Annual Leave plus 5 Public Holidays At St\nAndrews, equality, diversity, and inclusion are central to who we are and form\na core pillar of our University Strategy. We are committed to creating a fair,\ninclusive and supportive workplace, reflected in our participation in national\ndiversity charters and awards, including Athena Swan, Carer Positive and the\nRace Equality Charter. We particularly welcome applications from people from Black, Asian,\nminority ethnic and minority religions backgrounds and from LGBTQ+ and disabled\npeople. Closing date: 12 October 2026 Interview date: To be confirmed Please quote ref: CG8458CM Job description: CG8458CM FPs.pdf Estates Salary: Grade 3, £25,353-£26,707 per annum Start date: As soon as possible Duration: Permanent, Full Time Apply now Back to search results Service Desk Assistant - CG8458 School/Unit: Estates Posted: 18/09/2026 Closing date: 12/10/2026 Closing time: 23:59 (BST) Apply now Save Share Login Register Email Address: Please enter a valid email address. Password: Sign in Forgot password? Your password has expired, please create a new password below. Your email address has not been verified. Please check your email or click here to resend. Verification email has been resent. Email Address: Please enter a valid email address. Reset password Cancel Email Address: New Password: At least 8 characters Uppercase Lowercase Symbols Numbers Confirm Password: Update Password Your login attempt was not successful. Please try again Please select Dr Miss Mr Mrs Ms Other Professor Reverend Reverend DR Sir Dr. des. Assistant Professor Mx Title * First name * Last name * Email address * Password * At least 8 characters Uppercase Lowercase Symbols Numbers Confirm password * I have read and understood the terms and conditions I have read and understood the data protection statement Create Account Cancel An email has been sent to your email address. Please confirm that your email address is active by clicking the link in the email. Powered by engage|ats Havas People a Havas Company This site is protected by reCAPTCHA. Contact Us - Application Query Terms and Conditions About Privacy Policy Cookies Accessibility FAQs"
